	<script type="application/ld+json" class="yoast-schema-graph">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"NewsArticle","@id":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/"},"author":"Facebook company","headline":"Threads Expands Podcast Toolkit for Creators and Listeners","datePublished":"2026-09-16T14:53:31+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/"},"wordCount":228,"publisher":{"@id":"https://about.fb.com/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Threads-Podcasts-Header.png?w=1200","articleSection":["Product News","Recent News","Sidebar - Featured","Threads"],"inLanguage":"en-US","articleBody":"We’re announcing new Threads tools for podcast creators and listeners, giving creators more ways to share their shows and listeners more ways to have conversations around the podcasts they love.\r\n\r\nHere are some of the new features rolling out today: \r\n\r\n \tShow off your podcast: You can now display banners across your profile and posts, so listeners can more easily find your show. \r\n \tShare your best work: Feature your favorite episode with the episode picker, and make  your podcast links appear as a tappable card. \r\n \tBroadcast the highlights: You can now share standout moments and featured guests with transcript, video, and guest card posts. \r\n\r\n[video autoplay=\"true\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" mp4=\"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Threads_Podcasts_Asset_B_ALT.mp4\"][/video]\r\n\r\n \tSave your faves: You can now save episodes you come across in your feed, so never lose track of the content that’s catching your attention. \r\n \tKeep them coming back: You can opt in to getting an automatic notification from Threads reminding you to share new episodes with your audience\r\n \tGet to know your audience: Insights now show the reach and engagement Threads is driving for a podcast, including clicks and saves.\r\n\r\nThreads is already a place where people are connecting around podcasts, and these updates make it even easier to join conversations about your favorite shows.","description":"We’re announcing new Threads tools for podcast creators and listeners, giving you more ways to have conversations around the podcasts you love.","isAccessibleForFree":true},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/","url":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/","name":"Threads Expands Podcast Toolkit for Creators and Listeners","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://about.fb.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/#primaryimage"},"image":{"@id":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https://about.fb.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Threads-Podcasts-Header.png?fit=1920%2C1080","datePublished":"2026-09-16T14:53:31+00:00","description":"We’re announcing new Threads tools for podcast creators and listeners, giving you more ways to have conversations around the podcasts you love.","breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/#breadcrumb"},"inLanguage":"en-US","potentialAction":[{"@type":"ReadAction","target":["https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-podcast-toolkit-for-creators-and-listeners/"]}],"author":"Meta Newsroom"},{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/threads-expands-